# Tests

## Layout

- Tests live under `test/` as native ESM `.js` files (`**/test/**/*.test.js`)
- Import **compiled** code from `target/`, never from `src/`

```javascript
import { YoutubeUtil } from '../../target/util/youtube-util.js'
```

## Workflow

- Prefer `npm test` (runs `build` then Jest with `--experimental-vm-modules`)
- After editing `src/`, rebuild before expecting tests to see changes — otherwise they run stale `target/`
- Typecheck is the build; there is no lint script

## What to test

- Prefer pure unit tests of guards and utils (e.g. `audio-play-guard`, `youtube-util`, `ffmpeg-util`)
- Do not add live Discord gateway or xAI network calls in unit tests
- When changing race/invariant helpers, update the matching guard tests in the same change
